---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Layout
  title={`Terms · ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`Terms of use for ${SITE.name}.`}
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="page-head wrap"><h1>Terms</h1><p>Pet photos, credits, and finished clips.</p></div>
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <p>Pet photos only. Do not upload people. Not an official recording, label, or show. Ceiling Fan is generated — never strap a phone to a fan.</p>
    <p>One credit is about one second of a clip. Generate uses the credits for that look when it is queued. If the clip does not finish, those credits return to the account. A new account starts at zero credits. A card is charged only after a pack purchase is completed. Finished clips are labeled as generated.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
